      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOW HIGH (3) was a last start winner (23.59) at Bendigo who is building a strong winning record. Got the money at his only try from this box. In sparkling form and expected to measure up again. DING'S SANDY (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (23.16) at this track behind Pay Time in a Grade 4/5. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Must be included in calculations. INDY MELMEN (2) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at Sandown following on from a second place finish (29.53) there the start prior. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Better than last start and can bounce back. MAXIMUM DAMAGE (4) was strongly fancied last time but finished sixth (30.38) at Wentworth Park, bringing a three-run winning streak to an end. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts.",
